.input|xhtml/1.0
.# A list following a definition list in a list item, and a definition list without term following a code block or a
.# table: they are separated by an empty line so that they're not read back as part of the previous block
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><body><ul><li>a<dl><dt>t</dt><dd>d</dd></dl><ul><li>b</li></ul></li></ul><pre>c</pre><dl><dd>d</dd></dl><table><tr><td>e</td></tr></table><dl><dd>f</dd></dl></body></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
* a

  t
  :   d

    * b

{{verbatim}}
c
{{/verbatim}}

:   d

|     |
| --- |
|  e  |

:   f
